{"unit_id": "tag:009H:prose-0006", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n关于拓扑基（basis）<MATH_0001>上的集合（sets）值层（sheaves）的讨论到此结束。设<MATH_0002>为一种代数结构（algebraic structure）。在本节末尾，我们想指出，上述构造也适用于取值于<MATH_0003>的层（sheaves）。下面简要定义相关概念。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "notes": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "basis", "target_term": "拓扑基"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "algebraic structure", "target_term": "代数结构"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "basis", "target_term": "拓扑基", "context": "讨论层所依托的拓扑基"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合", "context": "层的取值类型"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层", "context": "拓扑基上的集合值层"}, {"source_term": "algebraic structure", "target_term": "代数结构", "context": "规定层的代数取值类型"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层", "context": "具有指定取值类型的层"}]}
