{"unit_id": "tag:009H:prose-0007", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n此时可如下定义<TEXTITOPEN_0001>茎（stalk）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>：对点<MATH_0001>，取值于<MATH_0002>且定义在<MATH_0003>上的预层（presheaf）在该点所得的就是有向余极限（directed colimit）\n<MATH_0004>\n它作为<MATH_0005>的对象（object）存在，这是由我们对<MATH_0006>的假设所保证的。此外可见，<MATH_0007>的底层集合（set）是茎（stalk），取自<MATH_0008>上的集合（sets）值底层预层（presheaf）。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n注意，引理<REF_0001>、<REF_0002>和<REF_0003>涉及层性质（sheaf property），而我们用相应的集合（sets）值预层（presheaf）定义了这一性质。因此，这些引理不需改动便可推广到取值于<MATH_0009>的预层（presheaf）。引理<REF_0004>的类似结论需要稍加处理，见下文。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "notes": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "stalk", "target_term": "茎"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "directed colimit", "target_term": "有向余极限"}, {"source_term": "object", "target_term": "对象"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "stalk", "target_term": "茎"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "sheaf property", "target_term": "层性质"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "stalk", "target_term": "茎", "context": "定义预层在指定点的茎"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层", "context": "取茎的对象"}, {"source_term": "directed colimit", "target_term": "有向余极限", "context": "构造茎的余极限"}, {"source_term": "object", "target_term": "对象", "context": "说明所构造的茎在哪类对象中存在"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合", "context": "茎忘掉代数结构后的底层集合"}, {"source_term": "stalk", "target_term": "茎", "context": "底层预层的茎"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合", "context": "底层预层的取值类型"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层", "context": "用来计算茎的底层预层"}, {"source_term": "sheaf property", "target_term": "层性质", "context": "所引引理讨论的性质"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合", "context": "相应预层的取值类型"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "targ