{"unit_id": "tag:009Q:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为拓扑空间（topological space）。设<MATH_0002>为一种代数结构（algebraic structure）。设<MATH_0003>为<MATH_0004>上拓扑（topology）的基（basis）。设<MATH_0005>为一个层（sheaf），取值于<MATH_0006>并定义在<MATH_0007>上。存在唯一的层（sheaf）<MATH_0008>，取值于<MATH_0009>并定义在<MATH_0010>上，使得<MATH_0011>对所有<MATH_0012>成立，且与限制映射（restriction mappings）相容。\n", "allowed_english": [], "notes": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "algebraic structure", "target_term": "代数结构"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "basis", "target_term": "基"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "restriction mappings", "target_term": "限制映射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间", "context": "引理的底空间"}, {"source_term": "algebraic structure", "target_term": "代数结构", "context": "指定层取值的类型"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑", "context": "给定基所对应的拓扑"}, {"source_term": "basis", "target_term": "基", "context": "底空间拓扑的基"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "给定于基上的层"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "存在且唯一的延拓层"}, {"source_term": "restriction mappings", "target_term": "限制映射", "context": "等式须与这些映射相容"}]}
{"unit_id": "tag:009Q:proof", "translation": "根据对二元组<MATH_0001>所加的条件，只需构造一个预层（presheaf）<MATH_0002>，使其在集合（sets）值底层预层（underlying presheaves）的层面上满足所需条件。因此，首先要构造合适的对象（object）<MATH_0003>，对每个开集（open）<MATH_0004>都这样做。我们可以仿照引理<REF_0001>，在<MATH_0005>上的预层（presheaves）情形中作此构造。不过，也有如下略有不同但基本等价（equivalent）的方法。将它定义为有向余极限（directed colimit）\n<MATH_0006>\n其中指标遍历所有覆盖（coverings）<MATH_0007>，覆盖由<MATH_0008>给出，取余极限的对象为纤维积（fibre product）\n<MATH_0009>\n按照通常的论证，见引理<REF_0002>和例<REF_0003>，只需证明这一构造在底层集合（underlying sets）上与上面使用<MATH_0010>的定义相同。细节留给读者。\n", "allowed_english": [], "notes": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "underlying presheaves", "target_term": "底层预层"}, {"source_term": "object", "target_term": "对象"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集"}, {"source_term": "presheaves", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价"}, {"source_term": "directed colimit", "target_term": "有向余极限"}, {"source_term": "coverings", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "fibre product", "target_term": "纤维积"}, {"source_term": "underlying sets", "target_term": "底层集合"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层", "context": "证明中要构造的预层"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合", "context": "底层预层的取值类型"}, {"source_term": "underlying presheaves", "target_term": "底层预层", "context": "应用所给条件时考察的层面"}, {"source_term": "object", "target_term": "对象", "context": "预层在每个开集上的取值"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集", "context": "逐个构造对象时所取的开集"}, {"source_term": "presheaves", "target_term": "预层", "context": "可以仿照所引引理处理的情形"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价", "context": "比较两种构造方法"}, {"source_term": "directed colimit", "target_term": "有向余极限", "context": "由所有覆盖上的纤维积构造取值"}, {"source_term": "coverings", "target_term": "覆盖", "context": "有向余极限的指标"}, {"source_term": "fibre product", "target_term": "纤维积", "context": "对每个覆盖取的积"}, {"source_term": "underlying sets", "target_term": "底层集合", "context": "用来比较两个构造的集合"}]}
{"unit_id": "tag:009H:prose-0008", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n注意，在该引理的情形下，有<MATH_0001>，其中的两边均为<MATH_0002>中的对象（objects）。这是因为，<MATH_0003>中包含<MATH_0004>的全体元素（elements）构成<MATH_0005>的一个开邻域（open neighbourhoods）基本系（fundamental system）。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "notes": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "objects", "target_term": "对象"}, {"source_term": "elements", "target_term": "元素"}, {"source_term": "open neighbourhoods", "target_term": "开邻域"}, {"source_term": "fundamental system", "target_term": "基本系"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "objects", "target_term": "对象", "context": "引理中的等式作为代数结构对象成立"}, {"source_term": "elements", "target_term": "元素", "context": "组成邻域基本系的基元素"}, {"source_term": "open neighbourhoods", "target_term": "开邻域", "context": "基本系中各元素所属的邻域类型"}, {"source_term": "fundamental system", "target_term": "基本系", "context": "由含指定点的基元素所构成的系"}]}
{"unit_id": "tag:009R:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为拓扑空间（topological space）。设<MATH_0002>为<MATH_0003>上拓扑（topology）的基（basis）。设<MATH_0004>为一种代数结构（algebraic structure）。用<MATH_0005>表示取值于<MATH_0006>且定义在<MATH_0007>上的层（sheaves）所成的范畴（category）。存在范畴等价（equivalence of categories）\n<MATH_0008>\n它将<MATH_0009>上的每个层（sheaf）送到该层在<MATH_0010>的各成员（members）上的限制（restriction）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "notes": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "basis", "target_term": "基"}, {"source_term": "algebraic structure", "target_term": "代数结构"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "equivalence of categories", "target_term": "范畴等价"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "members", "target_term": "成员"}, {"source_term": "restriction", "target_term": "限制"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间", "context": "引理中给定的空间"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑", "context": "给定基所对应的拓扑"}, {"source_term": "basis", "target_term": "基", "context": "底空间拓扑的基"}, {"source_term": "algebraic structure", "target_term": "代数结构", "context": "指定层的取值类型"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层", "context": "构成所记范畴的对象"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "所记的层范畴"}, {"source_term": "equivalence of categories", "target_term": "范畴等价", "context": "层范畴之间的等价"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "该范畴等价所作用的每个层"}, {"source_term": "members", "target_term": "成员", "context": "用来限制层的各基元素"}, {"source_term": "restriction", "target_term": "限制", "context": "范畴等价把层送到在各基成员上的限制"}]}
