{"unit_id": "tag:009H:prose-0009", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n最后来看拓扑基（basis）上的模（modules）的（预）层（sheaves）。我们将用到以下容易看出的事实：拓扑基（basis）上的集合值预层（presheaves of sets）范畴（category）具有积（products），这些积由在基（bases）的各元素（elements）上对取值（values）取积（products）来描述。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "notes": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "basis", "target_term": "拓扑基"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "basis", "target_term": "拓扑基"}, {"source_term": "presheaves of sets", "target_term": "集合值预层"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "products", "target_term": "积"}, {"source_term": "bases", "target_term": "基"}, {"source_term": "elements", "target_term": "元素"}, {"source_term": "values", "target_term": "取值"}, {"source_term": "products", "target_term": "积"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "basis", "target_term": "拓扑基", "context": "模的预层或层所定义的基"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "所考察的预层或层的取值类型"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层", "context": "此处与预层合称"}, {"source_term": "basis", "target_term": "拓扑基", "context": "定义集合值预层的基"}, {"source_term": "presheaves of sets", "target_term": "集合值预层", "context": "组成具有积的范畴的对象"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "讨论其中的积"}, {"source_term": "products", "target_term": "积", "context": "该范畴中存在的积"}, {"source_term": "bases", "target_term": "基", "context": "逐个取值时用到的基"}, {"source_term": "elements", "target_term": "元素", "context": "逐个计算取值的基元素"}, {"source_term": "values", "target_term": "取值", "context": "逐个基元素处用来取积的值"}, {"source_term": "products", "target_term": "积", "context": "对各基元素处的取值所取的积"}]}
{"unit_id": "tag:009S:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为拓扑空间（topological space）。设<MATH_0002>为<MATH_0003>上拓扑（topology）的基（basis）。设<MATH_0004>为预层（presheaf），取值为环（rings），定义在<MATH_0005>上。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <TEXTITOPEN_0001><MATH_0006>-模（modules）预层（presheaf）<MATH_0007>，定义在<MATH_0008>上<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，是定义在<MATH_0009>上的取值为阿贝尔群（abelian groups）的预层（presheaf），并配有一个集合（sets）值预层的（of presheaves）态射（morphism）<MATH_0010>，使得对所有<MATH_0011>，映射（map）\n<MATH_0012>\n使群（group）<MATH_0013>成为<MATH_0014>-模（module）。\n<STRUCT_0003> <TEXTITOPEN_0002>态射（morphism）<MATH_0015>（连接<MATH_0016>-模（modules）在<MATH_0017>上的预层（of presheaves））<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>是阿贝尔（abelian）预层（presheaves）在<MATH_0018>上的态射（morphism），它诱导<MATH_0019>-模（module）同态（homomorphism）\n<MATH_0020>，对每个<MATH_0021>均如此。\n<STRUCT_0004> 假设<MATH_0022>为环层（sheaf of rings），定义在<MATH_0023>上。<TEXTITOPEN_0003>层（sheaf）<MATH_0024>（由<MATH_0025>-模（modules）组成，定义在<MATH_0026>上）<TEXTITCLOSE_0003>是<MATH_0027>-模（modules）预层（presheaf），定义在<MATH_0028>上，其阿贝尔群（abelian groups）值底层预层（presheaf）是层（sheaf）。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n", "allowed_english": [], "notes": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "basis", "target_term": "基"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "rings", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "abelian groups", "target_term": "阿贝尔群"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "of presheaves", "target_term": "预层的"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "group", "target_term": "群"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "of presheaves", "target_term": "预