{"unit_id": "tag:009H:prose-0010", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n可如下定义<TEXTITOPEN_0001>茎（stalk）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>：在<MATH_0001>处，对<MATH_0002>-模（modules）在<MATH_0003>上的预层（presheaf），取有向余极限（directed colimit）\n<MATH_0004>\n它是一个<MATH_0005>-模（module）。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n注意，引理<REF_0001>、<REF_0002>和<REF_0003>涉及层性质（sheaf property），而我们用相应的集合（sets）值预层（presheaf）定义了这一性质。因此，这些引理不需改动便可推广到<MATH_0006>-模（modules）预层（presheaf）的概念。引理<REF_0004>的类似结论如下。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "notes": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "stalk", "target_term": "茎"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "directed colimit", "target_term": "有向余极限"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "sheaf property", "target_term": "层性质"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "stalk", "target_term": "茎", "context": "所定义的预层在指定点的茎"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "用来定义茎的预层的取值类型"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层", "context": "取茎的对象"}, {"source_term": "directed colimit", "target_term": "有向余极限", "context": "构造茎的余极限"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "所构造的茎具有的结构"}, {"source_term": "sheaf property", "target_term": "层性质", "context": "所引引理讨论的性质"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合", "context": "相应预层的取值类型"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层", "context": "用来定义层性质的相应预层"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "所推广到的预层的取值类型"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层", "context": "所引引理推广到的对象"}]}
{"unit_id": "tag:009T:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为拓扑空间（topological space）。设<MATH_0002>为<MATH_0003>上拓扑（topology）的基（basis）。设<MATH_0004>为环层（sheaf of rings），定义在<MATH_0005>上。设<MATH_0006>为层（sheaf），由<MATH_0007>-模（modules）组成，定义在<MATH_0008>上。设<MATH_0009>为<MATH_0010>上延拓<MATH_0011>的环层（sheaf of rings），并设<MATH_0012>为<MATH_0013>上延拓<MATH_0014>的阿贝尔层（abelian sheaf），见引理<REF_0001>。存在典范映射（canonical map）\n<MATH_0015>\n它在<MATH_0016>的各元素（elements）上与给定映射（map）一致，并赋予<MATH_0017>以<MATH_0018>-模（module）结构。\n", "allowed_english": [], "notes": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "basis", "target_term": "基"}, {"source_term": "sheaf of rings", "target_term": "环层"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "sheaf of rings", "target_term": "环层"}, {"source_term": "abelian sheaf", "target_term": "阿贝尔层"}, {"source_term": "canonical map", "target_term": "典范映射"}, {"source_term": "elements", "target_term": "元素"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间", "context": "引理中给定的空间"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑", "context": "给定基所对应的拓扑"}, {"source_term": "basis", "target_term": "基", "context": "底空间拓扑的基"}, {"source_term": "sheaf of rings", "target_term": "环层", "context": "给定在基上的环层"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "给定在基上的模层"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "给定层的模类型"}, {"source_term": "sheaf of rings", "target_term": "环层", "context": "由基延拓得到的环层"}, {"source_term": "abelian sheaf", "target_term": "阿贝尔层", "context": "由基延拓得到的阿贝尔层"}, {"source_term": "canonical map", "target_term": "典范映射", "context": "引理断言存在且赋予模结构的映射"}, {"source_term": "elements", "target_term": "元素", "context": "比较两个映射取值的基元素"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term