{"unit_id": "tag:009T:proof", "translation": "只需在集合值预层（presheaves of sets）的层面上构造乘法映射（multiplication map）。要看出这一点，或许最简单的办法是直接证明，若<MATH_0001>、<MATH_0002>和<MATH_0003>、<MATH_0004>满足<MATH_0005>，则元素（element）<MATH_0006>也满足<MATH_0007>。这样就得到所需的结果，因为在引理<REF_0001>的证明中，我们用茎（stalks）的元素（elements）所成的族（families）来构造延拓（extension），这些族满足<MATH_0008>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "notes": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "presheaves of sets", "target_term": "集合值预层"}, {"source_term": "multiplication map", "target_term": "乘法映射"}, {"source_term": "element", "target_term": "元素"}, {"source_term": "stalks", "target_term": "茎"}, {"source_term": "elements", "target_term": "元素"}, {"source_term": "families", "target_term": "族"}, {"source_term": "extension", "target_term": "延拓"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "presheaves of sets", "target_term": "集合值预层", "context": "构造乘法映射时只需处理这一层面"}, {"source_term": "multiplication map", "target_term": "乘法映射", "context": "证明中要构造的映射"}, {"source_term": "element", "target_term": "元素", "context": "直接证明中须满足指定条件的元素"}, {"source_term": "stalks", "target_term": "茎", "context": "所用元素来自这些茎"}, {"source_term": "elements", "target_term": "元素", "context": "组成延拓构造所用的族"}, {"source_term": "families", "target_term": "族", "context": "以满足指定条件的族描述延拓"}, {"source_term": "extension", "target_term": "延拓", "context": "所引引理的证明中构造的对象"}]}
{"unit_id": "tag:009H:prose-0011", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n注意，在该引理的情形下，有<MATH_0001>，此处按<MATH_0002>-模（modules）理解。这是因为<MATH_0003>中包含<MATH_0004>的全体元素（elements）构成<MATH_0005>的一个开邻域（open neighbourhoods）基本系（fundamental system），或者只需注意，这在底层集合（underlying sets）上成立。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "notes": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "elements", "target_term": "元素"}, {"source_term": "open neighbourhoods", "target_term": "开邻域"}, {"source_term": "fundamental system", "target_term": "基本系"}, {"source_term": "underlying sets", "target_term": "底层集合"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "说明引理中的关系在模结构下成立"}, {"source_term": "elements", "target_term": "元素", "context": "所取基本系中的各个基元素"}, {"source_term": "open neighbourhoods", "target_term": "开邻域", "context": "基本系中各元素所属的邻域类型"}, {"source_term": "fundamental system", "target_term": "基本系", "context": "由含指定点的基元素所构成的系"}, {"source_term": "underlying sets", "target_term": "底层集合", "context": "用来说明该关系成立的集合层面"}]}
{"unit_id": "tag:009U:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为拓扑空间（topological space）。设<MATH_0002>为<MATH_0003>上拓扑（topology）的基（basis）。设<MATH_0004>为环层（sheaf of rings），定义在<MATH_0005>上。用<MATH_0006>表示由<MATH_0007>-模（modules）在<MATH_0008>上的层（sheaves）组成的范畴（category）。存在范畴等价（equivalence of categories）\n<MATH_0009>\n它把<MATH_0010>-模（modules）在<MATH_0011>上的每个层（sheaf）送到该层在<MATH_0012>的各成员（members）上的限制（restriction）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "notes": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "basis", "target_term": "基"}, {"source_term": "sheaf of rings", "target_term": "环层"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "equivalence of categories", "target_term": "范畴等价"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "members", "target_term": "成员"}, {"source_term": "restriction", "target_term": "限制"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间", "context": "引理中给定的空间"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑", "context": "给定基所对应的拓扑"}, {"source_term": "basis", "target_term": "基", "context": "底空间拓扑的基"}, {"source_term": "sheaf of rings", "target_term": "环层", "context": "定义模层所需的给定层"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "所记范畴的对象的模类型"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层", "context": "组成所记范畴的对象"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "所记的模层范畴"}, {"source_term": "equivalence of categories", "target_term": "范畴等价", "context": "模层范畴之间的等价"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "范畴等价所作用的层的模类型"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "范畴等价所作用的对象"}, {"source_term": "members", "target_term": "成员", "context": "用来限制层的各基元素"}, {"source_term": "restriction", "target_term": "限制", "c