{"unit_id": "tag:009V:proof", "translation": "这一点是显然的，因为这族（collection）映射（maps）就相当于一个态射（morphism），它连接<MATH_0001>和<MATH_0002>在<MATH_0003>上的限制（restrictions）。由引理<REF_0001>，这也就是给出一个从<MATH_0004>到<MATH_0005>的态射（morphism）；再由引理<REF_0002>，这也就是给出一个<MATH_0006>-映射（map）。关于如何处理取值为代数结构（algebraic structures）的层（sheaves）的情形，另见引理<REF_0003>及其前面的讨论。\n", "allowed_english": [], "notes": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "collection", "target_term": "族"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "restrictions", "target_term": "限制"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "algebraic structures", "target_term": "代数结构"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "collection", "target_term": "族", "context": "把给定的逐处映射作为一族考察"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "确定两个限制之间的态射的给定映射"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "由给定映射确定的两个限制之间的态射"}, {"source_term": "restrictions", "target_term": "限制", "context": "给定态射的两个端点"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "由所引引理获得的态射"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "由另一所引引理对应到的指定类型的映射"}, {"source_term": "algebraic structures", "target_term": "代数结构", "context": "最后指明相关情形的层取值类型"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层", "context": "另引引理及前文处理的对象"}]}
